r: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><b>전시회 개요</b></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">□&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">전시회명&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: 2024&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">미국 실리콘밸리 국제발명전시회</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(SVIIF ‘24) [2024 Silicon Valley International Inventions Festival]</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">□&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">전시기간&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: 2024. 7. 26(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">～</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">28(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)[3</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">일간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">],&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">※&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">7.25(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">부스설치</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">□&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">개최장소&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">미국 캘리포니아주 산타클라라 컨벤션센터&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">[USA, Califonia, Santa Clara Convention Center]</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">□&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">개최규모&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: 22</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">개국</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, 400</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">여건</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(‘19</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">년 기준</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">□&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">주 최&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">국제발명가총연맹</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(IFIA) [</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">후원&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">세계지식재산기구</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(WIPO),&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">미국특허청</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(USPTO),&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">산타클라라시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">미국발명가협회</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">]</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">*상세 내용은 첨부파일 통해 확인해주세요.</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">신청기간 : 2024. 5. 31(금) ~ 6.7(금) 23:00 까지&nbsp;</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">결과발표 : 합격자 한하여 통보&nbsp;</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">신청방법&nbsp; : 첨부파일의 국외 경진대회 참가지원 신청서 다운로드 후 작성&nbsp; ▶ 이메일 제출<br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">제출처 : rnwldms92@kumoh.ac.kr</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">문의처&nbsp; : 창업지원팀 구지은 담당자 054-478-7898</p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">*2024년부터 국외 경비 지원의 경우 신청을 받아 운영위원회</span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">의&nbsp;심사를 거쳐 지원이 결정됩니다.</span><br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
